								being assigned a value when no storage_GB effective object exists, separated assignments into 2.3.1 and 2.3.2
								- added labels 2.3.1 
- 2.3.5
	2023-05-04		gblandford	https://jira.opentext.com/browse/ECOM-1335 Fix the usage start date for mid-cycle non-partner M365/CEP licenses. 
								There was a gap in the logic for mid-cycle billing and usage start_date, where if we were processing the license for the first time 
								and contract was in the past, we were setting usage start date incorrectly to contract start date day when it should be 1st day of previous 
								month per other licenses within that logic.
								- updated casing options and re-formatted some sections for readability, added schema prefixes and alias' where possible
